Rare UI for SwiftUI
===================

This package is a native SwiftUI port of Rare UI, a registry of animated
React components for the web.

    Rare UI: https://www.rareui.com
    https://github.com/swamimalode07/rare-ui
    Copyright (c) 2026 Swami Malode
    Licensed under the MIT License

Every component under Sources/RareUI/Components is a port of the matching
file in upstream's `components/ui` directory: the layout, the palette, the
interaction model and the animation constants are taken from that source
rather than reinvented. Test fixtures under Tests/RareUITests/Fixtures are
generated from the upstream sources so the numeric parts of the port can be
verified against the original.
